        "name": "why_we_like_it",
        "body": "What chefs David Fisher and Serena Chow Fisher did with Marlena, including garnering a Michelin star in its first year, expect much of the same here. Think: Seasonally-inspired dishes and tasting menus, beautiful desserts, and more."
      },
      {
        "name": "tagline",
