      {
        "name": "need_to_know",
        "body": "IMPORTANT RESERVATION INFORMATION: \n\n- NIGHTLY MENU: 7 Adams offers two unique styles of menu available to choose onsite daily: a 5-course choice of tasting menu for $87 dollars as well as a 7-course limited tasting menu for $127 dollars. Unfortunately, we cannot accommodate any allergies or modifications for the 7-course menu at this time. \n\nAdditionally, we have 6 Chef Counter seats available nightly featuring a highly curated 8-10 course menu for $157. This menu is highly seasonal, changes frequently, and cannot accommodate any allergies or restrictions. \n\n- LIMITED SEATINGS: All tables are reserved for a scheduled amount of time: 1 hour & 45 minutes for parties of 2 guests, 2 hours for parties of 3-5 guests and up to 2 hours & thirty for parties of 6+ guests. Please arrive on time with your completed party. If you're running late by more than 10 minutes, please notify us and be aware that your dining time may be shortened in order to accommodate the next scheduled reservation. \n\n- STRICT CANCELLATION POLICY: We require 48 hours notice for free cancellations. Cancellations and rebookings within 48 hours are subject to a cancellation/no-show fee of $87/person. "
      },
      {
        "name": "about",
        "body": "7 Adams, helmed by husband-and-wife chef duo David Fisher and Serena Fisher, offers a culinary journey that transforms the familiar into uniquely crafted and gorgeously presented dishes. A deeply personal project, the restaurant honors the spaces where David’s desire to cook first took hold, its name referencing his childhood home in Upstate New York. Drawing on local produce and capturing nuanced seasonal moments, 7 Adams also celebrates Serena’s roots in Northern California."
      },
