    },
    "content": [
      {
        "name": "why_we_like_it",
        "body": "With locations in both New York and San Francisco, Flatiron has emerged as one of the premier wine retailers in the country. They have access to nearly every top-tier producer in New and Old Worlds alike — but the staff is just as comfortable helping with a $15 bottle for a Tuesday night as with grand cru Burgundy. The spacious SF store has not only an impressive selection of California wines both old and new, but remarkable depth of grower Champagne. (Pro tip: Don't miss special deals available via their regular emails.)"
      },
      {
        "name": "tagline",
        "body": "Flatiron Wines is for the curious. For adventurers and explorers. For anyone who loves wine or small batch spirits, and wants to learn and taste more."
      },
      {
        "name": "from_the_venue",
        "body": null
      },
      {
        "name": "need_to_know",
        "body": "- Though the Wine Bar is available for walk-ins on a first come, first served basis, reservations are highly encouraged.\n- If you are interested in booking a party of 7 or more, please reach out to francesca.maniace@flatiron-wines.com to inquire about our Group Experiences.\n\nWe also offer reservations for virtual wine consultations. These reservations are not for in store appointments, or group wine experiences. Once you make a reservation, the shop will give you a phone call at your slotted reservation time. If you have a moment beforehand, think about wines, regions or other topics you might like to discuss, and perhaps a few of your favorite wines. That will help to make the conversation as productive as possible."
      },
      {
        "name": "about",
        "body": "Flatiron Wines is for the curious. For adventurers and explorers. For anyone who loves wine or small-batch spirits, and wants to learn and taste more.\n\nVisit our San Francisco wine bar to discover exceptional bottles by the glass, enjoy guided tastings with our team and other industry experts, or settle in for an afternoon of exploration. Our private Cellar Room event space is perfect for intimate gatherings, corporate events, and wine-focused celebrations.\n\nBrowse our retail selection of thousands of artisanal wines—from everyday values to rare finds, natural and organic selections, and small-batch spirits. Available for pickup or delivery throughout the Bay Area."
      },
      {
        "name": "pickup_description",
        "body": null
      }
    ]
  }
}

